Here's my measurements for my RT82, I used both my Marconi signalgenerator and the TinySA signalgenerator, same settings as OH2FHJ.<br>Tried to get some average on the low level RSSI values that was jumping a bit.  <br><br>The TinySA has a decent SG but it seemed to flatten out below -110 dBm compared to the Marconi 2022D, but a TinySA could be a an alternative<br>to an expensive SA &amp; SG.<br><br>I got some variance on some values when I repeated the measurements (with both instruments) , maybe something with AGC and dual receiver ?  <br><br><a href="https://www.sa0bux.se/Ham/opengd77/rt82_rssi_messurments.ods" class="postlink">https://www.sa0bux.se/Ham/opengd77/rt82 ... rments.ods</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2867">SA0BUX</a> — Sun Feb 11, 2024 9:30 am</p><hr />
